e their interval bounds can reach around 10% even though point estimates are small; I registered subgroup/context proposals. H12 was the intended technical QC control for POLR2A; it shows no clear association and is closed as a technical check. Overall, the dataset contains two canonical-looking very strong dependency associations in this dataset, while other biomarker effects are weaker, opposite, or uncertain. These are dataset associations, not causal claims, and possible confounding by co-mutations, subtype, culture, omics completeness, and batch remains a caveat.",
